WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.880
Dixon, this is Granger.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.600
What are you doing?

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.280
Get control of Alpha now!

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.040
Men down! Medevac needed!

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.040
Seven murders on Scottish soil.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.760
We need to visit the
 base in Wudyan.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.160
But you're okay with it?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.240
Well, I'm not due 
for another two months

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.640
and you put me on this case.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.480
You’ll love Wudyan.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.000
Nobody tells the 
truth there either.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.560
Somebody told them what we we're doing here.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.400
Find out who.

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.200
We’re all suspects?

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.040
Yes, of course we are!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:29.920
You need to keep 
your head down.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.400
Are you asking me if I did this?

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.280
Why were you there?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.960
Those drones are 
tools for repression.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.520
My dad didn't 
do anything wrong.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.240
Police! Stay where you are!

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.880
What evidence 
do you even have?

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.760
I have enough.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.360
You should try to complete your work quickly.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:45.560
They are lying to you.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.920
Amy!

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:47.760
Look up.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.040
Come home.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.000
I can’t.

